Package: hexagonrpcd
Version: 0.4.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kumar <kumar@nabu>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), systemd
Description: FastRPC reverse-listener server exposing the SLPI sensors filesystem on Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu)
 The DSP sensors (SSC) connect back over FastRPC on the sdsp channel;
 hexagonrpcd serves the sensor config/registry over that channel and
 re-synchronizes sensor state on suspend/resume.
